          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I located manufacturing order **MO-25-09-1070** and confirmed that September entered Pending Close at **2025-09-30T18:00:00**. The supplied Oracle policy is available, but the event records needed to verify the transaction, amount, creation time, and accounting status are access-restricted. I’ll request an authorized extract; I won’t change any database records.",
